    {
      "policy": "The 4 MiB metadata retention limit drops a larger FLAC comment block",
      "undecided": "RFC 9639 sections 8.1 and 8.6 allow comment blocks of up to 2^24 - 1 bytes; the elementary reader's Limits::retained_metadata_bytes keeps 4 MiB by default.",
      "rule": "Returns the track without the unretained comments.",
      "documented": "crates/elementary/README.md#behaviour-and-limits",
      "reference_rule": "Publishes the 16770684-byte comment, or eight joined fields of up to 15848084 bytes in the combined file.",
