    },
    {
      "policy": "Stream facts from a CRC-checked frame of a file without a FLAC header",
      "undecided": "RFC 9639 sections 6 and 9.1 require fLaC and STREAMINFO first, so this file is not conforming; a frame header carries its own rate and channels. The elementary reader documents markerless access.",
      "rule": "Reports 44100 Hz and one channel from the first confirmed frame, with no STREAMINFO and no duration.",
      "documented": "crates/elementary/README.md#behaviour-and-limits",
      "reference_rule": "Reports no rate, channels, STREAMINFO or duration.",
      "compat": "none: no compat item reproduces the reference's rule",
      "cases": [
        "11---file-starting-with-unparsable-data.flac"
