      "policy": "A leading ID3v2 tag before AC-3 or E-AC-3 is read",
      "undecided": "ID3v2.4 main structure section 3.1 and native frames section 4.2 define the tag; ATSC A/52 does not carry tags, and the elementary reader reads a leading tag before any audio format.",
      "rule": "Reports the syncframe properties and the tag's text: TITLE Hello, or the twelve mapped text fields.",
      "documented": "crates/elementary/README.md#behaviour-and-limits",
      "reference_rule": "Reports the same syncframe properties with an empty dictionary.",
